.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Implementation of the machine-related functions\&. 

This file contains the implementation of various functions related to the machine, such as generating binary image files, loading memory initialization files, reading from RAM and disk, and performing page walks for Sv32 page translation\&. 
.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "void binfile_gen (\fBCPU\fP * s, uint8_t * ram, uint8_t * sector)"

.PP
Generate a binary image file for FPGA run\&. This function generates a binary image file named 'inits\&.bin' based on the provided RAM and sector data\&. It writes the RAM data, device tree data, and disk sector data to the file\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIs\fP Pointer to the \fBCPU\fP object\&. 
.br
\fIram\fP Pointer to the RAM data\&. 
.br
\fIsector\fP Pointer to the disk sector data\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "uint32_t disk_read (uint32_t addr, uint32_t n, uint8_t * dsk)"

.PP
Read data from disk\&. This function reads data from the disk at the specified address and with the specified access size\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIaddr\fP Address to read from\&. 
.br
\fIn\fP Access size in bytes (1, 2, or 4)\&. 
.br
\fIdsk\fP Pointer to the disk data\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The read data\&. 
.RE
.PP

