.SS "int page_walk (uint32_t v_addr, uint32_t * p_addr, PTE_ACCESS access, \fBCPU\fP * cpu, uint8_t * mmem)"

.PP
Perform Sv32 page walk\&. This function performs the Sv32 page walk for the given virtual address and returns the corresponding physical address\&. It also handles page faults and updates the page table entries if necessary\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIv_addr\fP Virtual address to translate\&. 
.br
\fIp_addr\fP Pointer to store the physical address\&. 
.br
\fIaccess\fP Access type (read or write)\&. 
.br
\fIcpu\fP Pointer to the \fBCPU\fP object\&. 
.br
\fImmem\fP Pointer to the main memory data\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
0 if the translation is successful, -1 if there is a page fault\&. 
.RE
.PP

